OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: The Venetian
OL,6,G     School
OL,7,     F5/5. Donald Macleod explores the
OL,8,     Fmusic of 3 different men called
OL,9,     FGiovanni employed by St Mark's.
OL,10,G1700 In Tune
OL,11,     FKatie Derham welcomes composer and
OL,12,     Fpianist Alexis Ffrench to 80A for
OL,13,     Fa live performance. Tenor Joseph
OL,14,     FCalleja talks to Katie from
OL,15,     FWexford Festival Opera.
